{"page": 2, "segments": [{"index": 0, "text": "Selection Sort", "rects": [[62.25, 56.24958038330078, 157.5900115966797, 70.34957885742188]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0000.wav", "duration": 1.7}, {"index": 1, "text": "for i = 1 to n-1\n    min = i\n    for j = i+1 to n\n        if A[j] < A[min]\n            min = j\n    swap A[i] with A[min]", "rects": [[62.25, 82.35032653808594, 177.83404541015625, 96.31832885742188], [62.25, 96.31907653808594, 141.71401977539062, 110.28707885742188], [62.25, 110.28782653808594, 206.73004150390625, 124.25582885742188], [62.25, 124.25657653808594, 235.62600708007812, 138.22457885742188], [62.25, 138.22532653808594, 199.50604248046875, 152.19332885742188], [62.25, 152.19407653808594, 242.85000610351562, 166.16207885742188]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0001.wav", "duration": 12.65}, {"index": 2, "text": "Loop invariant: A[1:i-1] sorted with i-1 smallest elements.\nComplexity: \u0398(n\u00b2) worst, best, and average.\nIn-place, not stable (long-distance swaps).", "rects": [[92.25, 178.16282653808594, 443.5260314941406, 192.13082885742188], [92.25, 192.13157653808594, 358.4221496582031, 206.09957885742188], [92.25, 206.10032653808594, 349.20599365234375, 220.06832885742188]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0002.wav", "duration": 12.55}, {"index": 3, "text": "Binary Search", "rects": [[62.25, 232.06597900390625, 157.35000610351562, 246.16598510742188]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0003.wav", "duration": 1.725}, {"index": 4, "text": "left = 1, right = n\nwhile left \u2264 right\n    mid = \u230a(left+right)/2\u230b\n    if A[mid] == key return mid\n    if A[mid] < key left = mid+1\n    else right = mid-1\nreturn NIL", "rects": [[62.25, 258.166748046875, 199.50604248046875, 272.1347351074219], [62.25, 272.135498046875, 192.28204345703125, 286.1034851074219], [62.25, 286.104248046875, 250.07398986816406, 300.0722351074219], [62.25, 300.072998046875, 286.1939392089844, 314.0409851074219], [62.25, 314.041748046875, 293.4179382324219, 328.0097351074219], [62.25, 328.010498046875, 221.1780242919922, 341.9784851074219], [62.25, 341.979248046875, 134.49002075195312, 355.9472351074219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0004.wav", "duration": 17.5}, {"index": 5, "text": "Precondition: A is sorted. \u0398(lg n) worst-case.\nInvariant: key \u2208 A[left:right] if key \u2208 A at all. Correctness via bisection.\nVariant: interpolation search O(lg lg n) for uniform distribution.", "rects": [[92.25, 367.947998046875, 365.778076171875, 381.9159851074219], [92.25, 381.916748046875, 527.8621215820312, 395.8847351074219], [92.25, 395.885498046875, 480.5221252441406, 409.8534851074219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0005.wav", "duration": 15.325}, {"index": 6, "text": "Loop Invariant Proof Pattern 1. Initialization: Invariant true before first\niteration 2. Maintenance: If true before iteration, remains true before next\n3. Termination: Loop terminates; invariant + termination gives correctness", "rects": [[62.25, 421.85113525390625, 527.1654052734375, 435.9511413574219], [62.25, 436.080810546875, 525.995361328125, 450.0487976074219], [62.25, 450.178466796875, 529.3295288085938, 464.1464538574219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0006.wav", "duration": 17.525}, {"index": 7, "text": "Comparisons | Dimension | Insertion Sort | Merge Sort | |\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2013|\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014|\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014| | Worst-case | \u0398(n\u00b2) | \u0398(n lg n) | | Best-case | \u0398(n) | \u0398(n lg n) | | In-\nplace | Yes | No | | Method | Incremental | Divide-and-conquer |", "rects": [[62.25, 476.14410400390625, 529.877197265625, 490.2441101074219], [62.25, 490.244873046875, 519.294189453125, 504.2128601074219], [62.25, 504.213623046875, 447.078125, 518.1815795898438]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0007.wav", "duration": 14.675}, {"index": 8, "text": "Formulas: Merge sort recurrence T(n) = 2T(n/2) + \u0398(n). General D&C: T(n)\n= aT(n/b) + D(n) + C(n).", "rects": [[62.25, 530.1792602539062, 529.4592895507812, 544.2792358398438], [62.25, 544.280029296875, 212.26202392578125, 558.2479858398438]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0008.wav", "duration": 12.025}, {"index": 9, "text": "End-of-Chapter: Exercises 2.1-1 through 2.3-6; Problems 2-1 (coarsening),\n2-2 (bubblesort), 2-3 (Horner\u2019s rule), 2-4 (inversions).", "rects": [[62.25, 570.2456665039062, 525.2365112304688, 584.3456420898438], [62.25, 584.346435546875, 388.9500427246094, 598.3143920898438]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0009.wav", "duration": 11.275}, {"index": 10, "text": "Ch. 3 \u2014 Characterizing Running Times", "rects": [[62.25, 625.8519897460938, 368.87921142578125, 642.3487548828125]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0010.wav", "duration": 3.4}, {"index": 11, "text": "Asymptotic Notations - O-notation (big-oh): O(g(n)) = {f(n): \u2203 c > 0, n\u2080 >\n0 such that 0 \u2264 f(n) \u2264 cg(n) for all n \u2265 n\u2080}. Asymptotic upper bound. - \u03a9-\nnotation (big-omega): \u03a9(g(n)) = {f(n): \u2203 c > 0, n\u2080 > 0 such that 0 \u2264 cg(n) \u2264\nf(n) for all n \u2265 n\u2080}. Asymptotic lower bound.", "rects": [[62.25, 656.38623046875, 526.1444702148438, 670.4862060546875], [62.25, 670.48388671875, 507.9646911621094, 684.5838623046875], [62.25, 684.58154296875, 525.5792236328125, 698.6815185546875], [62.25, 698.8112182617188, 332.42999267578125, 712.7791748046875]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0011.wav", "duration": 33.35}, {"index": 12, "text": "- \u0398-notation (theta): \u0398(g(n)) =\n{f(n): \u2203 c\u2081, c\u2082 > 0, n\u2080 > 0 such that 0 \u2264 c\u2081g(n) \u2264 f(n) \u2264 c\u2082g(n)}. Tight bound. - \no-notation (little-oh): f(n) \u2208 o(g(n)) if \u2200 c > 0 \u2203 n\u2080: 0 \u2264 f(n) < cg(n). Equivalently lim f(n)/g(n) = 0. Not asymptotically tight.", "rects": [[336.2460021972656, 698.8112182617188, 526.927978515625, 712.7791748046875], [62.25, 712.7799682617188, 534.93017578125, 726.7479248046875], [62.25, 726.74560546875, 473.2114562988281, 740.8455810546875], [62.25, 740.9752807617188, 399.36602783203125, 754.9432373046875]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0012.wav", "duration": 28.3}, {"index": 13, "text": "- \u03c9-notation (little-\nomega): f(n) \u2208 \u03c9(g(n)) if \u2200 c > 0 \u2203 n\u2080: 0 \u2264 cg(n) < f(n). Equivalently lim f(n)/\ng(n) = \u221e.", "rects": [[403.1820373535156, 740.9752807617188, 525.1423950195312, 754.9432373046875], [62.25, 754.9440307617188, 522.798095703125, 768.9119873046875], [62.25, 768.9127197265625, 118.51799774169922, 782.8806762695312]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0013.wav", "duration": 13.375}, {"index": 14, "text": "\u2022 \n\u2022 \n\u2022", "rects": [[81.357421875, 178.16282653808594, 92.25342559814453, 192.13082885742188], [81.357421875, 192.13157653808594, 92.25342559814453, 206.09957885742188], [81.357421875, 206.10032653808594, 88.43742370605469, 220.06832885742188], [81.357421875, 367.947998046875, 92.25342559814453, 381.9159851074219], [81.357421875, 381.916748046875, 92.25342559814453, 395.8847351074219], [81.357421875, 395.885498046875, 88.43742370605469, 409.8534851074219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0014.wav", "duration": 0}, {"index": 15, "text": "\u2022 \n\u2022 \n\u2022", "rects": [[81.357421875, 178.16282653808594, 92.25342559814453, 192.13082885742188], [81.357421875, 192.13157653808594, 92.25342559814453, 206.09957885742188], [81.357421875, 206.10032653808594, 88.43742370605469, 220.06832885742188], [81.357421875, 367.947998046875, 92.25342559814453, 381.9159851074219], [81.357421875, 381.916748046875, 92.25342559814453, 395.8847351074219], [81.357421875, 395.885498046875, 88.43742370605469, 409.8534851074219]], "audio_url": "/static/sessions/5408c658/pages/2/audio/seg_0015.wav", "duration": 0}], "total_segments": 16, "status": "ready"}